      "title": "MiniMax H3 Director · fl2v",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Director — fl2v (GGUF)\n\n1. 确认 UnetLoaderGGUF / ClipProj / Video VAE / Audio VAE 文件名与本地一致\n2. 文本编码器用 `CCTechClipProjLoader`：`type` 选 `boogu`，projection 选 `mmh3-8b-ClipProj-v3.1.safetensors`\n3. 在导演台节点内编辑提示词与帧数（默认 124≈5s @24fps）\n4. Queue Prompt\n\n本地模型：\n- diffusion_models/`minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned-Q4_K_M.gguf`\n- text_encoders/`qwen3-vl-8b-heretic-1.3.0_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` + `mmh3-8b-ClipProj-v3.1.safetensors`\n- vae/`minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` / `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
